---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Contact"
description: "Start a conversation with Revora about pricing, promotions, portfolio or trade terms. No cost, no obligation — just a straight answer on whether we can help."
permalink: /contact/
darkHeader: true
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">Contact</span>
    <h1>Tell us what's in front of you</h1>
    <p class="lede">A cost increase to land, a promo plan that isn't paying, a range review on the horizon &mdash; whatever it is, the first conversation costs nothing and comes with a straight answer.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-info reveal">
      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <p>No sales sequence, no discovery workshops before you've decided anything. Here's the actual process:</p>
      <ol class="next-steps">
        <li><span class="n">1</span><span>We reply within one working day to set up a call at a time that suits you.</span></li>
        <li><span class="n">2</span><span>On the call (20&ndash;30 minutes) we dig into the problem and tell you honestly whether we think we can move the numbers.</span></li>
        <li><span class="n">3</span><span>If it makes sense to go further, you'll get a short written proposal &mdash; scope, timing, fee &mdash; within the week. If it doesn't, we'll say so and suggest where else to look.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="contact-direct">
        <p><strong>Prefer to skip the form?</strong></p>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        <p>Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form class="contact-form reveal" name="contact" method="POST" action="/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
      <p class="visually-hidden">
        <label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field"></label>
      </p>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="company">Company</label>
        <input type="text" id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="email">Work email</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="phone">Phone <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
        <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel">
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="topic">What's this mostly about?</label>
        <select id="topic" name="topic">
          <option>Pricing / price pack architecture</option>
          <option>Promotions / trade investment</option>
          <option>Portfolio / range</option>
          <option>Trade terms / negotiations</option>
          <option>Not sure yet — that's fine</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="message">What's going on?</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A few sentences is plenty — we'll dig into the detail on the call." required></textarea>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
      <p class="form-note">We'll only use your details to respond to this enquiry. No newsletters unless you ask for one.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
